{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Dinner</strong> is a <strong>short psychological</strong> horror game that explores the unraveling mind of Erick \u2014 a war veteran haunted by guilt and disturbing memories as he tries to live a normal life with his family.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though Erick believes he's getting better, his hallucinations say otherwise. He clings to routine, but something sinister lingers beneath the surface. A single day at home becomes a descent into a mind that refuses to forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>...until the worst happens.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Day That Won\u2019t End</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform ordinary household tasks while the environment subtly turns against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537410/extras/489c0f487da29b0bdd6fd544bdb5a207.poster.avif?t=1757307137\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537410/extras/489c0f487da29b0bdd6fd544bdb5a207.webm?t=1757307137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537410/extras/489c0f487da29b0bdd6fd544bdb5a207.mp4?t=1757307137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Mind</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take medication or play music to ease hallucinations and stabilize your perception of reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Psychological Storytelling</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover a tragic past through environmental clues, inner monologues, and playable flashbacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537410/extras/a585c177cf5363ae625319b11bc88cde.poster.avif?t=1757307137\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537410/extras/a585c177cf5363ae625319b11bc88cde.webm?t=1757307137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537410/extras/a585c177cf5363ae625319b11bc88cde.mp4?t=1757307137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Visceral Memories</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into Erick\u2019s most repressed moments \u2014 moments that twist the familiar into something terrifying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Traumatic Ending</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Erick's trauma manifests itself in his actions.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3537410?t=1757307137","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3537410?t=1757307137","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537410/8ddc6c1886239a858cd8112c7b8729f08a046e5b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757307137","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537410/8ddc6c1886239a858cd8112c7b8729f08a046e5b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757307137","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains psychological horror themes, including hallucinations, stroboscopic effects, unsettling imagery, and scenes of gore."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"ap